    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d281">

                <pb facs="0407" n="327" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg327"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Squiers to Mr.
                            Hay</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Habana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-07-04"><hi rendition="#italic">July 4,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>President Palma writes that he shares with the people of the United States the
                    happiness they enjoy in celebrating this holiday, the anniversary of the
                    Independence of the thirteen English colonies, which, by the blessing of
                    democratic institutions and love of liberty, have reached the highest stand as
                    one of the most powerful nations in the world, and heartily wishes that the
                    American people may enjoy forever the greatest prosperity and happiness.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Squiers.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
